<title>EGYPT: Cairo brokerage suspended two weeks for violations.</title>
<headline>Cairo brokerage suspended two weeks for violations.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Egypt's Capital Market Authority said on Thursday it was suspending Horus Brokerage Company for two weeks with effect from September 15 for violations of the capital markets law. It did not specify the violations.</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +20 2 578 3290/1</p>
